Add following line to ~/.bashrc
source ~/dev-shortcuts/bash/extensions.sh

NOTE: change the path of dev-shortcuts to your local path


Recommendations:
- Store kubeconfig for production in a separate file
- Use the default kubeconfig file for local development
- Please refer to bash/dev-config/readme for details.

Prod Commands:
kprod <ns> <verb> [resource] [options]
kprod <ns> <verb> [*<resource>] [options] # *<resource> applies grep on the returned resoruces to filter them out.

if <ns> is not applicable:
Pass on - for <ns>, it will pull the cluster resources

if you want to run raw command:
kprod -- [-n <ns>] <verb> [resource] [options]

Local environment:
- Replace kprod with klocal to use default kubeconfig.
- klocal uses default kubeconfig
- example: klocal <ns> <verb> [resource] [options]
- klocal appropriately switches to use the default kubeconfig

Options:
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Option   | Long Option        | Description                                                                                                                                   |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-A`     | `--all-namespaces` | Search across all namespaces.                                                                                                                 |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-s`     | `--sort-by`        | Sort resources. <br>Accepts: `a`, `ts`, or `age` (sort by creationTimestamp), `-` (no sort), or any `.field.path`. Default: `.metadata.name`. |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-nn`    | `--node-name`      | Filter by node name. Uses Kubernetes field selector `spec.nodeName=<value>`.                                                                  |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| -p|-g|-r | `--search-pattern` | Pattern to search in logs.                                                                                                                    |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-oless` | `-less`            | Show output in `less` with `-oyaml` format.                                                                                                   |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-ocode` | `-code`            | Open output in VS Code (`code`) with `-oyaml` format.                                                                                         |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-oyaml` |                    | Output format in YAML.                                                                                                                        |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-ojson` |                    | Output format in JSON.                                                                                                                        |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-l`     |                    | Label selector. Must be in format: `-l key=value`. Cannot be used with resource name.                                                         |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-go`    |                    | Language runtime set to `go`. Used to format logs.                                                                                            |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-net`   |                    | Language runtime set to `.NET`. Used to format logs.                                                                                          |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `-w`     | `--watch`          | Enable Kubernetes watch mode.                                                                                                                 |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `--`     |                    | Signals that the following arguments are direct commands.                                                                                     |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
|*<pattern>|                    | Wildcard for resource name pattern (e.g., `nginx-*`).                                                                                         |
| -------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
